            <note corresp="#d440-f4" n="4" xml:id="d440-f4-content">
                <p>See <ref target="#d150-f3">footnote 3, Document 150</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d440-f5" n="5" xml:id="d440-f5-content">
                <p>Byroade reported in telegram 1098 from Cairo, December 8, that he had told Fawzi
                    about Dulles’ talk with Sharett along the lines suggested in this telegram.
                    (Department of State, Central Files, 684A.86/12–855)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d440-f6" n="6" xml:id="d440-f6-content">
                <p>Transmitted in telegram 1229 to Cairo, December 10, also sent to Tel Aviv and
                    London; not printed. (<hi rendition="#italic">Ibid</hi>., 684A.86/12–1055)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
